-<h2 id="ICUSyntax">ICU Syntax</h2>
-
-<p>In this section:</p>
-
-<ul class="overview">
-<li><a href="#ICUSyntax_ICURegularExpressionSyntax">ICU Regular Expression Syntax</a></li>
