-    <ul>
-      <li><a href="#NSString_RegexKitLiteAdditions__.captureCountForRegex:" class="code">+ captureCountForRegex:</a> <span class="deprecated">Deprecated in <span class="rkl">RegexKit<i>Lite</i></span> 3.0</span></li>
